 cases. However: - All AI-generated test cases must be reviewed by QA. - Test cases should be aligned with business requirements. - QA is responsible for the final accuracy and completeness	[0.06213381,0.1563845,-2.8685505,-0.4497415,0.74863064,-0.44780633,1.568945,-0.24770287,-0.3580207,-0.24457611,0.6824767,0.18124567,1.0385423,0.59753054,-0.54135704,-1.4213817,0.83029944,-1.2648838,-1.2635939,-0.56905824,0.5176072,-0.74944776,-0.94515115,-1.4754108,1.3807629,0.17297146,-0.7179151,-0.0016633369,-1.0775733,-0.4831918,0.949805,-0.7805805,0.8395939,-1.0300571,-0.18638147,-0.9316836,1.1056077,0.58106196,-0.14830641,0.1206914,0.39490828,-0.4547837,0.031109225,-1.3627086,0.53870916,0.40134373,1.131029,0.5226732,0.86083496,-0.9113834,0.3010219,-0.42325878,0.2925173,0.28254935,0.82883215,0.20530687,-0.5213198,0.87820196,-0.72294754,-0.593938,0.3002859,1.7767973,-0.42405424,0.5815034,0.41968626,-0.18420002,0.13324879,-0.31058994,0.36919034,-0.5325786,0.80944467,-0.8876339,1.0240219,0.29357886,0.11703896,-0.27543202,0.2280748,0.00034602833,-0.26450452,0.38656735,0.67905146,0.8604299,0.88382804,0.32498515,1.7161912,0.31825715,-0.870065,-0.29429147,-0.844823,1.375067,0.35283074,0.32933182,-0.16403535,1.0454867,-0.7169109,0.046829898,-0.085304394,-0.64644164,-0.78240716,0.41646352,0.542916,-1.3282609,0.25571033,0.11371774,-0.504117,1.2080936,-1.0376385,-0.035942983,-0.32829288,-0.040729582,-0.16763647,0.6484914,-0.9506023,-0.27678815,0.84508395,0.2366111,2.276948,0.025491903,0.32799295,0.23696105,-0.20190741,-0.06917722,0.7825532,0.15070996,0.24499829,0.40049613,-1.2067862,-0.5957413,0.40643066,-0.92768383,-0.53424376,-0.080650255,-0.05135251,-0.16073407,-0.22367047,0.9877012,0.30377346,-0.18186882,-0.29659304,-0.2952708,0.40542144,0.22490524,-0.17534861,0.5154414,0.7783399,-0.92585385,0.18605898,0.51797163,-0.6622494,0.14447087,-0.11502806,-0.75246906,0.22721954,0.12712401,0.4495986,-0.52631915,0.105161875,0.6052423,1.0810167,0.8033359,0.064782195,0.030909257,-1.307429,0.8830